{
  "verified_at": "2026-08-31",
  "note": "The question catalog of the mtg-corpus skill, section 11, as data. `slot` is the proto slot the answer informs. `key` is the question's own state key, and it defaults to the slot. A refinement question (budget scope, house format limits, named card role, commander pick) carries its own key, so a filled proto slot does not cancel it. Keep the rows in step with the skill file. TestCatalogMatchesCorpus checks it.",
  "rows": [
    {
